{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/Steam_desc.png?t=1741158087\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Under Rooms you take on the role of a 17-year-old teenager, you find yourself trapped in this mysterious and dangerous environment after an accident. Your mission is to survive, explore and discover your way back home. The gameplay focuses on looting, inventory management and crafting mechanics, allowing you to create and find essential resources for survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your journey, you will encounter various factions, each with their own ideologies and goals, creating a complex web of alliances and rivalries. Some factions refuse to cooperate due to their differences, while others offer the opportunity to make connections and find allies in the midst of chaos. However, danger is ever present: hostile entities lurk in the shadows, ready to destroy anyone who crosses their path. Explore uniquely designed locations, each with its own atmosphere and challenges, and immerse yourself in a narrative that gradually uncovers the story of your protagonist and the dark secrets of Backrooms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you survive and find your way out or will you be trapped in this endless world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot and manufacture: </strong>Find and create essential resources to keep you alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/crafting.gif?t=1741158087\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inventory management:</strong> Every item counts. Manage your equipment well or you may regret it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/8bNfFJ.gif?t=1741158087\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Factions and moral dilemmas: Different groups with their own beliefs and objectives. Who will you trust?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/meg.gif?t=1741158087\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/sci.gif?t=1741158087\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/uec.gif?t=1741158087\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/bohemian.gif?t=1741158087\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden narrative:</strong> Discover little by little the secrets of this world and the real reason why you ended up here with unique cinematics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/Snapshot_5.png?t=1741158087\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/Snapshot_1.png?t=1741158087\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/Snapshot_2.png?t=1741158087\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/Snapshot.png?t=1741158087\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/Snapshot_4.png?t=1741158087\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lurking entities:</strong> You are not alone... and not everything that dwells here wants to help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique and sinister places:</strong> Each level is a challenge with its own atmosphere, rules and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Can you escape the impossible, or will you become part of this world?</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531920?t=1741158087","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741158087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/e8e9625f3298b9cb1296f4dc566c2addb1edc9a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741158087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/e8e9625f3298b9cb1296f4dc566c2addb1edc9a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741158087","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/extras/Steam_desc.png?t=1741158087\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Under Rooms you take on the role of a 17-year-old teenager, you find yourself trapped in this mysterious and dangerous environment after an accident. Your mission is to survive, explore and discover your way back home. The gameplay focuses on looting, inventory management and crafting mechanics, allowing you to create and fi